# Sv32 supervisor-permission fault smoke test.
# Host setup preloads:
# - satp for the address space
# - mtvec = 0x20
# - x1 = translated virtual address
# - mstatus.MPRV with MPP=Supervisor and SUM cleared
# The mapped page is user-accessible, so the translated load should fault.
# Trap handler increments x10, records mcause in x11 and mtval in x12,
# advances mepc past the faulting load, and returns so mainline code can continue.
# Expect x10 = 1, x11 = 13, x12 = faulting virtual address, x13 = 1.
# Trailing nops leave safe speculative fetch space for the pipeline core.
0x0000a503
0x00168693
0x0000006f
0x00000013
0x00000013
0x00000013
0x00000013
0x00000013
0x00150513
0x342025f3
0x34302673
0x34102773
0x00470713
0x34171073
0x30200073
0x00000013
